---
import PageLayout from '@layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Proving the value of coaching | Free five-email briefing | Mentric"
  description="A free five-email briefing for people who run coaching and have to show it's working. Practical, honest and built around templates you can use straight away."
  hideStickyCta
>

  <Fragment slot="head">
    <!-- MailerLite Universal -->
    <script is:inline>
      (function(w,d,e,u,f,l,n){w[f]=w[f]||function(){(w[f].q=w[f].q||[])
      .push(arguments);},l=d.createElement(e),l.async=1,l.src=u,
      n=d.getElementsByTagName(e)[0],n.parentNode.insertBefore(l,n);})
      (window,document,'script','https://assets.mailerlite.com/js/universal.js','ml');
      ml('account', '2698798');
    </script>
    <!-- End MailerLite Universal -->
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Hero + form -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-glow-gradient">
    <div class="section-container py-10 md:py-14">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">

        <!-- Left: intro -->
        <div>
          <p class="category-label mb-4">Free briefing</p>
          <h1>Proving the value of coaching</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl">
            You know your coaching programme is making a difference. The hard part is showing it, in a way your leadership team trusts, without asking coachees to give up the confidentiality that makes coaching work.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl">
            This free briefing is five short emails, sent every few days, each with one practical idea and something you can use straight away.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: form -->
        <div class="card-editorial p-6 md:p-8" id="briefing-form">
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-6">Get the briefing</h2>

          <div class="ml-form-wrapper">
            <div class="ml-embedded" data-form="VcxWZd"></div>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
            Five emails over about two weeks. Free, and you can unsubscribe at any time. See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">privacy policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's in the five emails -->
  <section class="bg-background">
    <div class="section-container py-10 md:py-14">
      <h2>What's in the five emails</h2>

      <ol class="mt-8 space-y-8 list-none pl-0">
        <li class="card-editorial p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/60 mb-2">Email 1</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Your satisfaction scores might be underselling your coaching</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Why "I enjoyed it" is the wrong question, and three better ones to ask coachees and their managers.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-editorial p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/60 mb-2">Email 2</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Agree what "worth it" looks like before session one</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            How a short three-way conversation with the sponsor sets up everything you'll report on later.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary">Includes: sponsor expectations sheet</p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-editorial p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/60 mb-2">Email 3</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">What the board sees, and what stays in the room</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Where to draw the line between what gets reported and what stays private, so coachees can stay candid.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary">Includes: reporting boundary wording</p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-editorial p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/60 mb-2">Email 4</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Claim less, prove more</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Why big ROI figures backfire, and a more honest way to show impact that leaders actually believe.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary">Includes: success case interview script</p>
        </li>

        <li class="card-editorial p-6 md:p-8">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary/60 mb-2">Email 5</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Your one-page coaching impact report</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Pulling it all together into a single page you can put in front of your leadership team.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary">Includes: coaching impact report template</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who it's for -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-10 md:py-14">
      <h2>Who it's for</h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-base md:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5">
        <li>L&amp;D, HR and people leaders running coaching across their organisation who need to show it's working</li>
        <li>Coaching practices delivering programmes for clients who expect more than a satisfaction score</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base md:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
        It works whether you use internal coaches, external coaches or a mix.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why we wrote it -->
  <section class="bg-background">
    <div class="section-container py-10 md:py-14">
      <h2>Why we wrote it</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base md:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Mentric helps organisations and coaching practices run their coaching programmes in one place and show what they achieved. In our conversations, the same problem keeps coming up: everyone believes coaching works, but very few can show it convincingly. This briefing is what we'd tell anyone in that position, whether or not they ever use Mentric.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-ink font-medium">
        Richard Anderson, Co-founder, Mentric
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Questions -->
  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="section-container py-10 md:py-14">
      <h2>Questions</h2>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Is it really free?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">Yes. No card details, no trial, nothing to buy.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Is this a sales pitch in disguise?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            No. The first four emails are purely practical. The last one offers a free 20-minute review of how you report on coaching, if you'd find that useful. There's no obligation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl">Can I share it with colleagues or coaches I work with?</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Please do. Send them this page so they get the templates too.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="bg-plum-gradient">
    <div class="section-container py-10 md:py-14 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-white">Get the briefing</h2>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="#briefing-form" class="btn-primary-lg bg-white text-primary hover:bg-primary-50 hover:shadow-glow-lg">
          Get the briefing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  /* MailerLite form overrides — scoped to .ml-form-wrapper so they only affect this page */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedContainer) {
    background: transparent !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    border: none !important;
    border-radius: 0 !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedWrapper) {
    background: transparent !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    border: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedBody) {
    padding: 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedBody .ml-form-embedContent) {
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  /* Hide MailerLite's own heading — we have our own "Get the briefing" h2 */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedBody .ml-form-embedContent h4),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedBody .ml-form-embedContent p) {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* Font family */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedWrapper),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-formContent),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(label),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(button),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-successBody) {
    font-family: "scandia-web", "Inter", system-ui, sans-serif !important;
  }

  /* Labels */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(label) {
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    color: #2e0025 !important;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  /* Input fields — match demo form style */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="text"]),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="email"]),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="tel"]),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(select),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(textarea) {
    width: 100% !important;
    border-radius: 0.75rem !important;
    border: 1px solid #e8e8eb !important;
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem !important;
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    color: #2e0025 !important;
    transition: all 0.2s !important;
    outline: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="text"]::placeholder),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="email"]::placeholder),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="tel"]::placeholder),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(textarea::placeholder) {
    color: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.5) !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="text"]:focus),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="email"]:focus),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(input[type="tel"]:focus),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(select:focus),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(textarea:focus) {
    border-color: rgba(213, 45, 145, 0.5) !important;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(213, 45, 145, 0.3) !important;
    outline: none !important;
  }

  /* Submit button — pill shape, plum background */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedSubmit button),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(button[type="submit"]) {
    display: inline-flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    justify-content: center !important;
    padding: 0.75rem 2.5rem !important;
    border-radius: 0.75rem !important;
    background-color: #2f0027 !important;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    border: none !important;
    cursor: pointer !important;
    transition: all 0.3s ease-out !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    width: 100% !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedSubmit button:hover),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(button[type="submit"]:hover) {
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(192, 55, 147, 0.25) !important;
    transform: scale(1.02) !important;
  }

  /* Success state */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-successBody) {
    padding: 1rem 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-successBody .ml-form-successContent) {
    padding: 0 !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-successBody h4) {
    font-weight: 900 !important;
    color: #2e0025 !important;
    font-size: 1.25rem !important;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-successBody p) {
    color: #64748b !important;
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
  }

  /* Remove any MailerLite branding/footer */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedPermissions),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedTe498498) {
    display: none !important;
  }

  /* Form field rows spacing */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-fieldRow) {
    margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
  }

  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-embedSubmit) {
    margin-top: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  /* Checkbox / GDPR text */
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-checkboxRow label),
  .ml-form-wrapper :global(.ml-form-checkboxRow span) {
    font-size: 0.75rem !important;
    color: #64748b !important;
  }
</style>
